	(text "Diode-OR: buck 5 V or USB 5 V; neither back-feeds the other.\nAP2112K: 1 uF X7R on VIN and VOUT, EN tied to VIN (Diodes datasheet, Note 4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "041d671c-5307-40d7-847e-1861f3a0ffaf")
	)
	(text "Bus IN/OUT: J1 and J2 pins joined by wide planes, 15 A pass-through.\nNo on-board inrush limiting: external XT90-S anti-spark at the supply.\nBoth male (XT30PW-M); chain leads are female-female. Pad 2 = + (flat, chamfered end), pad 1 = - (rounded end)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "475244a5-db28-4701-b2ae-c2e16a5f38d0")
	)
	(text "LM5008A buck, 5 V out, 10 to 52 V in (SNVS583H 8.2 procedure, Fig. 10 topology):\nVOUT = 2.5 V x (R4 + R3) / R4 = 5.0 V   (R3 = RFB2 VOUT-FB, R4 = RFB1 FB-GND)\nR1 = RT 240k: Fs = VOUT / (1.385e-10 x RT) = 150 kHz; ton at 54 V = 616 ns, 410 ns at the -33% TON spread > 400 ns\nL1 = 120 uH: ripple 250 mA p-p at 54 V; Isat 850 mA > 610 mA max current limit\nR2 = RCL 383k: Toff = 1e-5 / (0.285 + 2.5 / (6.35e-6 x RCL)) = 7.5 us\nR5 = 1 Ohm in series with C15: >= 25 mV p-p ripple at FB\nC11 1 uF + C12 0.1 uF at VIN, C13 0.47 uF VCC, C14 10 nF BST-SW (TI Table 1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "572b536d-43ed-41bb-98f8-4b340b97c49e")
	)
	(text "Bulk: 16 x 4.7 uF 100 V X7R 1210 (C1-C10, C44-C49), about 2 uF each at 48 V. No electrolytic:\nthe ceramics carry the ~13 A RMS ripple at 20 A RMS phase (about 0.8 A each). 100 V >= 1.5 x 54 V.\nC1 / C5 / C9 and C50 / C51 / C52 (100 nF 0603) sit at each half-bridge (HS drain to shunt GND end);\nthe rest are bulk beside the FET row. Chain-cable damping is verified on the bench."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7bf13bfa-cc8b-4f26-a7ed-83b57a537107")
	)
